S\n\nThe tradition of using high-tech gadgets and signature techniques to remain unseen continues, with a full range of fluid moves, brutal takedowns, and experimental weapons.\n\nCOMPLETE IMMERSION\n\nFace intelligent enemies with personal attributes and reactive behaviors. NPCs are aware of their surroundings and remember past events. Powered by an advanced physics engine, the open-ended level design offers a wealth of interactive opportunities to outwit your foes.\n\nPlease note: online features for this game are no longer supported. Multiplayer and co-op modes are no longer functional.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/header.jpg?t=1764776065"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764776065"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/0000003892.600x338.jpg?t=1764776065","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/0000003892.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764776065"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/0000003893.600x338.jpg?t=1764776065","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/0000003893.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764776065"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/0000003987.600x338.jpg?t=1764776065","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/0000003987.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764776065"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/13570/0000003988.600x338.jpg?t=1764776065","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1